OL,3,GNEWSATrain wash depot plan for village
OL,4,Awithdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposal to build an East West Rail
OL,7,F(EWR) train maintenance centre by a
OL,8,Fvillage has been withdrawn.
OL,10,FThe company had suggested building the
OL,11,Ffacility at Fulbourn, just south of
OL,12,FCambridge.
OL,14,FCEO David Hughes said it was now
OL,15,Fconfident "existing rail industry-owned
OL,16,Fsites" would be able to meet the needs
OL,17,Fof the train operators.
OL,19,FPippa Heylings, the Liberal Democrat MP
OL,20,Ffor South Cambridgeshire, said: "This
OL,21,Fwill rightly bring much relief to local
OL,22,Fresidents and businesses."
